#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The requested documentation was not found on your computer. Normally, &kde; "
"looks for application handbooks in a location that depends on how &kde; was "
"installed on your computer. There are a number of possible reasons why it "
"could not find the documentation you requested. The document might not "
"exist, or it may not have been installed along with the application."
msgstr ""
"A documentación solicitada non se atopou no computador. Normalmente &kde; "
"busca os manuais dos aplicativos nun lugar que depende do xeito como se "
"instalase &kde; no computador. Hai varios motivos polos que isto puido "
"acontecer: quizais non exista a documentación, ou non se instalase xunto co "
"aplicativo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to solve this issue:"
msgstr "Como resolver este problema:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Start by searching the <ulink url=\"http://docs.kde.org/\">KDE Documentation "
"site</ulink> for the requested documentation. If you find the documentation "
"on that site, your distribution might ship a separate package for "
"documentation (&eg; called kdepim-doc for all applications from the kdepim "
"module, like &kmail;, &kontact;, &etc;). Please use the package manager of "
"your distribution to find and install the missing documentation."
msgstr ""
"Comece buscando no <ulink url=\"http://docs.kde.org/\">Sitio da "
"documentación de KDE</ulink> a documentación. Se a atopa, quizais o "
"distribuidor do aplicativo teña un paquete á parte para a documentación "
"(&eg; chamado kdepim-doc para todos os aplicativos do módulo kdepim, como "
"&kmail;, &kontact;, &etc;). Use o xestor de paquetes da distribución para "
"atopar e instalar a documentación que falte."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you use a source based distribution, such as Gentoo, be sure that there "
"are not any configuration settings (USE flags in Gentoo) that might have "
"disabled the installation of the documentation."
msgstr ""
"Se utiliza unha distribución baseada en fontes, como Gentoo, asegúrese de "
"que ningunha opción da configuración (os indicadores USE de Gentoo) poida "
"ter desactivado a instalación da documentación."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have done that, but still get this page displayed instead of the "
"application handbook, you probably found a bug in the &kde; help system. In "
"this case, please report this on the <ulink url=\"http://bugs.kde.org/\">KDE "
"Bug Tracker</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Se xa o fixo pero aínda se lle mostra esta páxina no canto do manual do "
"aplicativo, probabelmente atopase un fallo no sistema de axuda de &kde;. "
"Neste aso, informe del no <ulink url=\"http://bugs.kde.org/\">rastrexador de "
"erros de KDE</ulink>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you do not find any documentation on the <ulink url=\"http://docs.kde.org/"
"\">KDE Documentation site</ulink>, the application may not have offline "
"documentation. Please report this on the <ulink url=\"http://bugs.kde.org/"
"\">KDE Bug Tracker</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Se non atopou documentación ningunha no <ulink url=\"http://docs.kde.org/"
"\">Sitio da documentación de KDE</ulink>, quizais o aplicativo non teña "
"documentación sen conexión. Informe disto no <ulink url=\"http://bugs.kde."
"org/\">rastrexador de erros de KDE</ulink>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In case the application does not have offline documentation, you should use "
"the online resources <ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/\">UserBase "
"Documentation</ulink> and <ulink url=\"http://forum.kde.org/\">KDE Community "
"Forums</ulink> to get help."
msgstr ""
"Se o aplicativo non ten documentación sen conexión, debería usar os recursos "
"con conexión da <ulink url=\"http://userbase.kde.org/\">Documentación de "
"UserBase</ulink> e os <ulink url=\"http://forum.kde.org/\">Foros da "
"comunidade KDE</ulink> para obter axuda."
